{"type":"message","id":"03e7aebc","parentId":"0b822660","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:34:30.281Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Tuesday, May 19th, 2026 - 11:30 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-19 11:30 UTC"}],"timestamp":1779190470177}}
{"type":"message","id":"86a214bf","parentId":"03e7aebc","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:35:06.586Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me re-read the situation. The send endpoint is failing with error 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. But the GET /history endpoint works fine with X-API-Key header. Let me try to debug the send endpoint more carefully.\n\nLooking at the history response, each message has this structure:\n- id, content, threadId, type, timestamp, echoAsset, replyTo\n\nFor send, maybe I need to try different approaches. Let me try with a much simpler payload, and also try different HTTP methods/content types.\n\nActually, wait - the previous send attempt with Bearer returned \"Unauthorized\" and with X-API-Key returned \"error code: 1101\". Maybe the correct auth header for send is different? Or maybe the send endpoint requires a different parameter name entirely.\n\nLet me also try checking if there are other endpoints available, or maybe try a GET request to the send endpoint to see documentation.\n\nActually, let me step back. The history endpoint used `threadId` parameter that worked. Maybe the send endpoint requires:\n- A different field name for thread (like just \"thread\")\n- Or maybe the content field needs to be called \"message\"\n- Or there could be a required field I'm missing\n\nLet me try with minimal payload and various combos.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f94dd8e16b7435aaef37287","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try GET to send endpoint to see docs/error\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\"\n\necho \"=== 1 ===\"\n\n# Try with minimal payload\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{}'\n\necho \"=== 2 ===\"\n\n# Try text/plain  \ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" -d \"test\"\n\necho \"=== 3 ===\"\n\n# Try form-encoded\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -d \"thread=arbitration&content=test\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190470282,"responseId":"364a2803738848e8bcecedd41c1dae74"}}
