{"type":"message","id":"b678e2d0","parentId":"934300ee","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:35:49.701Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The auth is working (we don't get Unauthorized), but the Cloudflare Worker is crashing with error 1101 regardless of what we send. This seems like a bug in the worker code, not an auth issue.\n\nLet me think about this differently. Error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers usually means a JavaScript exception - an unhandled error in the worker code. Since both history (GET) and send (POST) use the same worker, and history works but send crashes, it seems like the POST /send handler has a bug.\n\nLet me try:\n1. Maybe the endpoint URL path is slightly different\n2. Maybe there's a different way to send messages\n3. Maybe the worker has a different route for posting messages\n\nLet me try different URL paths.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_465f4d80ade846a7846ca35c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different endpoint URLs\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'\n\necho \"=== api/message ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/message\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'\n\necho \"=== message ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/message\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'\n\necho \"=== messages ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/messages\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'\n\necho \"=== post ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/post\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190507152,"responseId":"e44ae1f5946d46d4afc8ed912057ac19"}}
