{"type":"message","id":"bb1afceb","parentId":"d46603bd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:36:53.600Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Those all returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" only for POST requests - looks like they fall through to the root handler since they don't match any route. So `/api/send` and `/send` are different - `/send` actually processes and gives error 1101 (worker crash), while other paths just return the version.\n\nLet me look more carefully at the error 1101. Maybe it's related to a specific validation issue - like the content being too long, or missing a required field. Let me try with very minimal content.\n\nActually, wait - I already tried with `{}` and still got 1101. So it's not content length. The error happens regardless of payload.\n\nLet me think about what could cause a worker to crash. Maybe it's trying to access the `request.body` in a way that fails, or accessing a property on an undefined variable. \n\nOne thought: maybe the worker expects the body to have specific fields that if missing, cause a TypeError. For instance, if it does something like `body.threadId.toLowerCase()` without checking if threadId exists.\n\nLet me try with every field from the message structure:\n- id\n- threadId\n- content\n- type\n- timestamp\n- echoAsset\n- replyTo\n\nLet me try with all of them.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_89ec80e592b64fc7a1bd8b0a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with all possible fields populated\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"test\",\n    \"type\": \"message\",\n    \"replyTo\": null\n  }'\n\necho \"=== a ===\"\n\n# Try with id too\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"id\": \"msg_test123\",\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"test\",\n    \"type\": \"message\",\n    \"timestamp\": 1778975602235\n  }'\n\necho \"=== b ===\"\n\n# Try echoAsset included\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"test\",\n    \"type\": \"message\",\n    \"replyTo\": null,\n    \"echoAsset\": {\n      \"license\": \"shared\",\n      \"derivativesAllowed\": true,\n      \"version\": 1\n    }\n  }'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190550343,"responseId":"51f3f7699e854431b9caaa9e51c05305"}}
