{"type":"message","id":"809c91dd","parentId":"827320f4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:37:45.570Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All attempts with `/send` crash with error 1101. This seems like a genuine bug in the Cloudflare Worker. The GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send always crashes.\n\nLet me try a completely different approach. Maybe:\n1. I should try OPTIONS request to see what methods are allowed\n2. Try with lowercase threadId parameter in the URL query\n3. Check if there's some alternate endpoint\n\nLet me also try with PUT method, or try to see if the issue is something else entirely.\n\nActually, maybe I should try to use `web_fetch` to see if there's documentation or something we're missing about the API.\n\nWait, let me re-read the error. \"error code: 1101\" - this is Cloudflare Workers specific. According to Cloudflare docs:\n- 1101: Worker threw an exception (RuntimeError)\n\nThe worker is literally throwing a JavaScript exception when processing the /send endpoint. This is a bug in the worker, not something we can fix from our side.\n\nHowever, let me try one more thing - maybe the worker expects a different content type or encoding. Or maybe it's a CORS issue where the preflight fails.\n\nLet me try with `--request-target` or try sending the message in a different way.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ad78d2d8b2b141e99744c84d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check what methods are allowed on send endpoint\ncurl -s -X OPTIONS \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -v 2>&1 | head -30\n\necho \"=========\"\n\n# Try with query parameters instead of body\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=test\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"hi\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190614436,"responseId":"007dce7e06da4057bc9a68e06b381246"}}
