{"type":"message","id":"267c06b7","parentId":"1badc729","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:38:18.038Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server says it didn't send a response or headers. The OPTIONS request just shows the SSL handshake but no response body, and the POST still gives 1101.\n\nThe send endpoint is crashing at the worker level. All combinations result in error 1101.\n\nLet me try if there's maybe a different POST endpoint that works, or if I should try the /api prefix with send. Also let me check if the worker handles anything differently with the /api prefix.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2015f83485854784a73c129e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check API docs or available routes\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"\necho \"===\"\n# Try /api/send but with /api prefix\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190666116,"responseId":"e4429c469025450d82d95b7b838e94ef"}}
