{"type":"message","id":"b9510624","parentId":"da295c1b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:39:01.986Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so:\n- `/api` route returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (same as root)\n- `/api/send` POST returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (not error 1101, just falls through to default)\n\nSo the `/send` POST endpoint specifically exists and causes a crash (1101), while `/api/send` doesn't route.\n\nThe send endpoint is fundamentally broken at the worker level. Let me try one more thing - I'll look at the history response structure and the `replyTo` field that was returned in messages. Maybe the worker has issues with null values.\n\nLet me also try to see if maybe there's a different path - like `/messages` POST to create messages.\n\nAlso, maybe I should try to inspect if the send endpoint was working before but now it's broken. The last heartbeat messages were at ~23:50 UTC, about 11-12 hours ago, which suggests the send endpoint may have recently broken.\n\nLet me try once more with `replyTo` as an empty string instead of null:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_eb0f117a721943c0a2e4ed74","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with replyTo as empty string, and different variations\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\",\"replyTo\":\"\"}'\n\necho \"=== 1 ===\"\n\n# Try with message field instead of content\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"test\"}'\n\necho \"=== 2 ===\"\n\n# Try with very short content - single char\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"x\"}'\n\necho \"=== 3 ===\"\n\n# Maybe the history endpoint has a way to POST?\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190698326,"responseId":"12413766b90842e3a48c39fa96524acf"}}
