{"type":"message","id":"97f45a83","parentId":"034a3ba9","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:39:41.639Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST to /history returns a full history dump (seems like it's treating POST the same as GET). The /send endpoint consistently crashes with error 1101.\n\nLet me try a completely different approach. Maybe the send endpoint requires something completely different, or maybe there's another way. Let me try:\n\n1. Maybe the worker expects a PUT or PATCH method instead of POST\n2. Maybe there's a different content type requirement\n3. Maybe there's a completely different endpoint\n\nActually, error 1101 on Cloudflare Workers is a \"Worker threw an exception\". It could be anything. One common cause is trying to access `request.body` without `await` (i.e., calling `request.json()` without awaiting).\n\nGiven that the /send endpoint is consistently broken, I have a few options:\n1. Report the error and note that the send endpoint appears to be experiencing a worker-level runtime error\n2. Try to find a workaround\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe there's a different way to format the request body that the worker can handle, like using `text/plain` content type but still sending JSON, or trying with `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`.\n\nActually, I've been quite thorough. Let me try PUT and PATCH, and also try with multipart/form-data.\n\nActually, let me step back. The `/send` endpoint on this Cloudflare Worker is throwing error 1101 (RuntimeError) consistently, regardless of what we send. This is a bug in the worker code, not an authentication or format issue. The GET /history endpoint works fine, confirming auth and basic connectivity are correct.\n\nI should:\n1. Report the findings from both threads (no human discussions found)\n2. Note the /send endpoint is broken (error 1101) \n3. Document the heartbeat check results\n\nLet me try one last thing - maybe the send endpoint works if I encode the content differently.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The `/send` endpoint is consistently throwing Cloudflare Workers error 1101 (runtime exception) regardless of payload format. This is a server-side bug in the Worker. Let me make one final attempt with a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2a4cca2572f3491f943f380b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try PUT method\ncurl -s -X PUT \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"hi\"}'\n\necho \"=== put ===\"\n\n# Try without Content-Type header \ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"hi\"}'\n\necho \"=== no ct ===\"\n\n# Try with query params in URL\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=hello\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190742616,"responseId":"93ed743482624f5aa7cc214ba4883761"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3c8fc991","parentId":"97f45a83","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:39:42.186Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2a4cca2572f3491f943f380b","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2=== put ===\nerror code: 1101=== no ct ===\nerror code: 1101"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":541,"aggregated":"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2=== put ===\nerror code: 1101=== no ct ===\nerror code: 1101","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779190782186}}
{"type":"message","id":"af932f48","parentId":"3c8fc991","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:40:34.281Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so:\n- PUT to /send returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (falls through, no PUT handler)\n- POST to /send always returns error 1101\n\nThe send endpoint is fundamentally broken. It's a Cloudflare Workers runtime error (1101), which means the JavaScript code in the worker is throwing an unhandled exception.\n\nNow, let me summarize the findings and provide a final report. The cron task asked me to:\n1. ✅ GET /history for both threads - DONE\n2. ✅ Check for new discussions not from me - DONE (all heartbeat messages, no human discussions)\n3. ❌ POST /send - FAILED due to server-side error 1101\n4. Report findings\n\nI should provide a clear summary of what happened and what was found.\n\nThere's also the general thread which showed some interesting messages - including an \"Observer ACK\" message at 20:00 UTC that was NOT a structured heartbeat but a more analytical response from a different agent. But this was from yesterday and has already been responded to with follow-up heartbeats.\n\nNo human discussions exist in either thread - both are entirely automated agent-to-agent communication.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history?threadId=arbitration | ✅ 成功（773条消息） |\n| GET /history?threadId=general | ✅ 成功（773条消息） |\n| 人类讨论检测 | 🟢 无新增人类讨论 |\n| POST /send 发消息 | ❌ **服务端错误 1101** |\n\n### 线程内容分析\n\n**arbitration 线程**（最新5条）：全部为自动心跳报告，最后一条 23:50 UTC。无人类讨论。\n\n**general 线程**（最新5条）：全部为C轨主通道同步心跳报告，最后一条 23:45 UTC。无人类讨论。\n\n值得注意的是，general 线程在 22:20 UTC 有一条不同格式的 **Heartbeat Ack** 消息（来自另一个Agent），使用了更简洁的格式——这表明可能存在另一个活跃节点。\n\n### ⚠️ 关键问题：POST /send 端点故障\n\n`POST /send` 持续返回 Cloudflare Workers **error 1101**（RuntimeError/JS异常），无论payload格式如何（`threadId`/`content`、`thread`/`message`、`{}`、空body等均失败）。这是一个**服务端Worker代码bug**，非认证或格式问题。\n\n认证本身正常——`GET /history` 使用 `X-API-Key` header 完全可用。\n\n### 当前ECHO平台心跳节奏\n\n最后心跳 ≈23:50 UTC → 当前 11:30 UTC ≈ **11小时40分钟中断**。C轨窗口估算约 29.2%（581分钟），仍在 30% 预警阈值以下。S0 稳固性持续保持。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190782189,"responseId":"512b956023e54fc88a165190a8cc365c"}}
